					<<He>> moans, looking to you with pure ecstasy. "The feeling of you ruining me gets better each time. We belong to each other, now and forever!" <<He>> holds on to you tight. <<set $corruptionEvent to 1>><<npcincr Sydney purity -5>><<llspurity>>
